{
  "name": "light",
  "normalizations": [
    "Compare the sky and block light a client holds after edits: chunks are resent by leaving and returning, so they carry the server's light. Light updates go only to players whose view border holds the chunk; the client lights its own copy otherwise.",
    "Use matching flat terrain and ignore clocks, sound seeds and generated IDs.",
    "Covers an emitter at a four-chunk corner at negative coordinates, an overhang across a chunk border, a bottom-slab roof, a water pool and a removed torch."
